  "body": "## What changed\nOnly add the Adaptive 3D air-entry note for a centre-cutting tool.\nKeep the planned motions unchanged.\n\n## Cause\nThe planner added the note without checking the tool.\nThe ladder requires a centre-cutting tool before it uses air entry.\n\n## Tests\nThe pin air_entry_note_matches_center_cutting_tool covers both tool settings.\nIt failed on unchanged production code and passed after the fix.\nRestoring upstream hsm.rs made the pin fail again.\nRestoring the fix made it pass again.\nThe quick gate passed all 35 steps.\nClippy passed for camcraft-motion with all targets and warnings denied.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\nNo .nc or .cl files changed.\n\n## Not exercised\nNo physical machine run or manual GUI check.\n\n## Overlaps\nNone found among open PRs for the changed files.\n\nEffort: medium\nChangelog: Correct the Adaptive 3D air-entry note for tools that are not centre-cutting.\n\nFixes #2468\n",
